business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"American (Traditional), Breakfast & Brunch, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"Food","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"agK5cXwnBQozM2M-5kLvzw","review_id":"jtM_bLHjoiN96-Yr50ANUg","date":"2020-03-08T13:13:23","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9443259835243225,"text_excerpt":"When I visited NOLA last year during Mardi Gras season, I discovered this place. Both me and my friend had gotten sick, but even though I couldn't taste much at that time, I could still tell the breakfast spaghetti at Red Gravy was awesome. I had to go back this year, and it was even better than it was before. Both times I was able to find street parking across from the restaurant easily. It is a short walk up to Canal Street. Love the exterior. The porch/balcony is painted red and the Red Gravy sign has a hand-painted look. There are lights strung and a banner on the upper balcony that looks like an American flag made up of positive words and affirmations. Inside, there was some knick-kn..."},{"business_id":"agK5cXwnBQozM2M-5kLvzw","review_id":"Q85UuLJpXEwXBaCZ569hOg","date":"2013-07-24T01:55:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9312269687652588,"text_excerpt":"I can't believe it has taken me so long to review Red Gravy, since this is one of my favorite food places in New Orleans. I've eaten there at least half a dozen times, breakfast, lunch and the relatively new dinner service. I am yet to have a bite of food there that would not be delicious, but let me just mention a few that stood out: chicken and waffles, several different types of bread pudding (I am a bread pudding lover and have tried several dozen different ones in town - Red Gravy has produced at least two that would be in my top 5 :-) ), meatballs with red gravy and the meal I had on my most recent visit there: the Nina panini (with incredibly delicious cranberry walnut mayo). I wil..."},{"business_id":"agK5cXwnBQozM2M-5kLvzw","review_id":"WOLb5M28vtVKlkYngNdjsg","date":"2013-10-13T23:09:59","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9299266934394836,"text_excerpt":"The beginning of our visit to Red Gravy was a little awkward. We didn't have a reservation and there were three of us. Upon talking to the hostess we were going to have to wait 10 minutes, which was fine. They, however, do not let you wait at the bar. When we asked if we could eat at the bar she said usually yes but tonight no. (Later we saw a gentleman eating at the bar, huh?!?) We were asked to wait outside until our table was ready. After we were sat things got better. The menu is full of options and the special that night was pancetta and ricotta ravioli. Bread is brought out with garlic olive oil. We also ordered the meatball appetizer and the cheese and meat board. Both were great. ..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"agK5cXwnBQozM2M-5kLvzw","photo_id":"1wKv0L8TD0bh0mOZrJQGPA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/1wKv0L8TD0bh0mOZrJQGPA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8830736875534058},{"business_id":"agK5cXwnBQozM2M-5kLvzw","photo_id":"fc9dPRh8A4g5O9itHoEJuQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/fc9dPRh8A4g5O9itHoEJuQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8761812448501587},{"business_id":"agK5cXwnBQozM2M-5kLvzw","photo_id":"H6YouHtYG7nCXEPeaTY5eg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/H6YouHtYG7nCXEPeaTY5eg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.860267698764801},{"business_id":"agK5cXwnBQozM2M-5kLvzw","photo_id":"yQnvkFwCUonG2BmK-N_MCA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/yQnvkFwCUonG2BmK-N_MCA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8450666069984436}]},"notebook_case":null}
